      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Collector policy <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>Damaged, missing, incorrect, or not as described? We’ll make it right. <a href="/pages/policy">Read the full collector policy</a>.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
